#: ../../../source/Capabilities/Simulation/URDF/URDF-Main.rst:19
msgid ""
"URDF (Unified Robot Description Format) is used to describe a robot's "
"structure, geometry, and physical properties for use in ROS. This article "
"introduces URDF and provides a set of tutorials for building, extending, and "
"using robot description files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Capabilities/Simulation/URDF/URDF-Main.rst:26
msgid ""
"URDF (Unified Robot Description Format) is a file format for specifying the "
"geometry and organization of robots in ROS. A URDF file follows the XML "
"format as described on `here <https://wiki.ros.org/urdf/XML>`_."
msgstr ""
